# Pairs with InstalledEqualsReviewed. The pin is what the operator reviewed; a source change that moves it lets
# an unreviewed manifest match.
MODULE: AppsSourceChangeRepins
TARGET: InstalledEqualsReviewed
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a source change re-pins the digest to the new manifest
PERTURBS: ChangeManifest

--- FIND
    /\ seen' = seen
    /\ obs' = NoObs
    /\ UNCHANGED <<pin, installed, roleGrants, rules, alias>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ seen' = seen
    /\ obs' = NoObs
    /\ pin' = Digest(m)
    /\ UNCHANGED <<installed, roleGrants, rules, alias>>
--- END
